    "intro": "BP Products North America obligated $413M in federal contracts in FY26 to date. BP Products North America has 22 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $18.8M and obligations up 566.6% year over year. Fiscal-year obligations show a shift from prior years: FY21 obligations were $510M, FY22 obligations were $1.6B, FY23 obligations were $1.2B, FY24 obligations were $967M, and FY25 obligations were $62M. Current-year totals are partial because the period is FY2026 to date. These figures are contract obligations except where tables list award-value figures for largest awards and expiring contracts, which are total contract values. This snapshot shows how BP Products North America’s federal funding in FY26 to date compares with the last five fiscal years and highlights the number and average size of awards received so far this fiscal year.",
